{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13214","headline":"酬李补阙 · 皇甫冉","name":"酬李补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年归客但心伤，三径无人已自荒。\n夕宿灵台伴烟月，晨趋建礼逐衣裳。\n偶因麋鹿随丰草，谬荷鸳鸾借末行。\n纵有谏书犹未献，春风拂地日空长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}